    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change your perspective, and the world transforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dimension Ascent&quot;</strong> is a puzzle-action platformer that utilizes perspective shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the way you see the world and take on unique puzzles and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Key Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Rotation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.poster.avif?t=1754297953\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.webm?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.mp4?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the map to create new paths and discover hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Shift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.poster.avif?t=1754297953\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.webm?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.mp4?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the world from the eyes of another entity to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Projection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.poster.avif?t=1754297953\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.webm?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.mp4?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in a unique way, seamlessly transitioning between 2D and 3D.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change your perspective, and the world transforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dimension Ascent&quot;</strong> is a puzzle-action platformer that utilizes perspective shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the way you see the world and take on unique puzzles and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Key Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Rotation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.poster.avif?t=1754297953\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.webm?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.mp4?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the map to create new paths and discover hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Shift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.poster.avif?t=1754297953\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.webm?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.mp4?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the world from the eyes of another entity to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Projection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.poster.avif?t=1754297953\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.webm?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.mp4?t=1754297953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in a unique way, seamlessly transitioning between 2D and 3D.</p>",
